<code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">mc-sa-coach.html</code> — complete rebuild:</p><ul class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-2.5 pl-7"><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">✅ Local <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">QUESTION_BANK</code> constant removed entirely</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">✅ <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">prefetchAndCount()</code> — fetches question count from Worker on subject/module change, shows "8 questions available — M6 — Hazards" before start</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">✅ <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">startSession()</code> — fetches full question array from Worker at session start, then shuffles locally</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">✅ Subject selector with all 9 subjects (EES, BIO, BS, HM, ES, CF, LEG, VISART, ANCH)</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">✅ Module pills render dynamically per subject (M5–M8 for science, T1–T4 for others)</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">✅ Image URLs constructed as <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">allawrance.github.io/{SUBJECT}/questions/images/{filename}</code></li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">✅ <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">?subject=EES</code> URL param supported on load (matches CUBE app pattern)</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">✅ Both MC mode and Coach Mode working; first-attempt XP (15) vs repeat (10) via localStorage
<code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">cube-proxy-worker-PATCH.js</code> — NOT a standalone Worker, it's a patch with two clearly labelled insert blocks:</p></li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">PASTE BLOCK A — paste immediately before <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">const NESA_DIRECTIVES_BASE</code>. Contains all nine <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">QUESTIONS_*</code> constants plus the <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">QUESTION_BANKS</code> router. <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">QUESTIONS_EES</code> has 8 real questions (2 per module M5–M8) ready to go.</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">PASTE BLOCK B — paste immediately before the existing <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">// ── GET /leaderboard</code> handler. Contains the new <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">GET /questions</code> endpoint.
but the issue is the size of the files and ability to expand the M/C questions later as well as store image files for specific stimulus multiple choice questions.  So suggest having the following (1) divide all into subject specific folders eg EES, Biology, Legal (2) Have a folder within each of the subject folders for images (3) Have a folder within each subject for the year eg 2024 where the HSC 20 multiple choice questions for each module ie modules 5, 6.7 &amp; 8 would be stored this allows for continues expansion over the years (4) the questions would be flagged by year, source, module so it is possible to select by year and by module type. (5) M/C cand also be sourced from other locations so would also have a folder called Year_Other which would be under each of the subject folders. Others could grow over time so may need to add eg Year_VIC if necessary.  (6) Students have the option to select by year and by module type or all.  (7) I would like the loaded in multiple choice questions to be hidden because it takes time to upload and install so suggest have all of them stored in [<a href="https://dash.cloudflare.com](https//dash.cloudflare.com/login" target="_blank" class="underline">https://dash.cloudflare.com](https://dash.cloudflare.com/login</a>) - Provide your feedback on these ideas and then provide a summary of what is done and where folders stored so I can download</li></ul><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-12 bg-gradient-to-t from-bg-300 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div></div><button class="pb-3 pt-1 text-xs text-text-500/80 hover:text-text-100 transition w-3/4 text-left rounded-lg">Show more</button></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 pointer-coarse:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><span class="text-text-500 text-xs flex items-center