<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Evaluation of Your Proposed Architecture</h3>
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">✅ Ideas 1–2: Subject folders with images subfolders</h4>
