yle="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div class="flex flex-row gap-2 relative"><div class="flex-1"><div data-testid="user-message" class="font-large !font-user-message py-0.5 grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 relative [&amp;_ul]:!space-y-0 [&amp;_ol]:!space-y-0 [&amp;_ul]:pl-8 [&amp;_ol]:pl-8" style="max-height: 200px; overflow: hidden; position: relative;"><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">It is a bit different to your instructions - Stage 1 — Create the KV Namespace in Cloudflare Dashboard</p><ol class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal space-y-2.5 pl-7"><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Go to [dash.cloudflare.com](<a href="https://dash.cloudflare.com/" target="_blank" class="underline">https://dash.cloudflare.com</a>) and log in</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">In the left sidebar: Workers &amp; Pages → KV</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Click Create a namespace</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Name it: <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">CUBE_QUESTIONS</code></li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">Click Add
That's it — namespace created. Now bind it to your Worker:</p></li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Go to Workers &amp; Pages → cube-proxy (your Worker)</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Click Settings → Bindings</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Click Add binding → KV Namespace</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Set:
<ul class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-2.5 pl-7"><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Variable name: <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">CUBE_QUESTIONS</code> (this is what the Worker code calls it)</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">KV Namespace: select <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">CUBE_QUESTIONS</code> from the dropdown</li></ul></li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Click Save - please update your instructions</li></ol><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-12 bg-gradient-to-t from-bg-300 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div></div><button class="pb-3 pt-1 text-xs text-text-500/80 hover:text-text-100 transition w-3/4 text-left rounded-lg">Show more</button></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 pointer-coarse:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><span class="text-text-500 text-xs flex items-center mr-2" id="base-ui-_r_472_">10:44</span><div class="flex items-center"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none rounded h-control font-sans text-body font-medium [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast focus-visible:shadow-focus text-primary aria-pressed:text-accent aspect-square w-control px-0 !text-muted hover:!text-primary" aria-label="Retry" id="base-ui-_r_47h_"